<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tambay 2.0 - ESP Flasher</title>
<script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/esp-web-tools@10/dist/web/install-button.js?module"></script>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui;background:#f6f6f6;color:#222;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.container{max-width:700px;width:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:28px}
h1{margin:0 0 8px}
.sub{color:#666;margin-bottom:20px}
.card{border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0}
esp-web-install-button{--esp-tools-button-color:#03a9f4;--esp-tools-button-text-color:#fff}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#e8f5e9;color:#2e7d32;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<span class="badge">● ONLINE</span>
<h1>Tambay 2.0 Vendo Flasher</h1>
<div class="sub">I-flash ang ESP32 mo directly sa browser</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Flash Firmware</h3>
<esp-web-install-button manifest="manifest.json">
<button slot="activate">INSTALL TAMBAY 2.0</button>
</esp-web-install-button>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
